{{!
  @template mod_moodleoverflow/mail/post_content_text

  One post in a plain text mail, included by the mails that show posts. Every value is printed unescaped with triple
  braces, as this is text, not HTML. Data from output\mail\post_content.

  Context variables required for this template:
  * url - Link to the post
  * by - "by <author> - <date>"
  * message - The post as plain text

  Example context (json):
  {
    "url": "https://example.com/mod/moodleoverflow/discussion.php?d=2#p5",
    "by": "by Jacob Brown - Monday, 2 November 2026, 10:15 AM",
    "message": "Your function has no base case."
  }
}}
{{{url}}}

{{{by}}}
---------------------------------------------------------------------
{{{message}}}
---------------------------------------------------------------------
